  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "So\u00felice he aras of heora gesamnunge & ferde on Simones hus. \u00d0a w\u00e6s Simones sweger geswenced on mycelum feferum, & hig hyne for hyre b\u00e6don. & he standende ofer hig \u00feam fefore bebead & he hig forlet & heo sona aras and him \u00feenode. So\u00f0lice \u00fea sunne asah ealle \u00fee untrume w\u00e6ron on mislicum adlum hig l\u00e6ddon him to & he \u00d0a ferdon \u00fea deoflu of manegum hrymende & cwe\u00f0ende, So\u00f0es \u00feu eart Godes sunu, & he ne \u00d0a gewordenum d\u00e6ge se H\u00e6lend utgangende ferde on weste stowe, & \u00fea meniu hine sohtun, & hi \u00dea s\u00e6de he him, so\u00f0lice me gedaf\u00e6na\u00f0 o\u00f0rum ceastrum Godes rice bodian, for\u00feam to \u00feam ic eom & he w\u00e6s bodigende on Galilea gesamnungum. So\u00felice w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea \u00f0a menegu him to comon \u00fe\u00e6t hig Godes word gehyrdon, he stod wi\u00f0 \u00feone & he geseah twa scipu standende wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne mere. \u00d0a fisceras eodun & wohson heora nett. He \u00fea astigende on an scyp, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Simones b\u00e6d hyne \u00fe\u00e6t he hit lythwon fram lande tuge, & on \u00d0a he sprecan geswac he cw\u00e6\u00fe to Simone, Teoh hit on dypan & l\u00e6ta\u00f0 eowre nett on \u00feone fiscwer. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe Simon him andswariende, Eala bebeodend ealle niht swincende we naht ne gefengon; So\u00f0lice & \u00fea hi \u00fe\u00e6t dydon hig betugon mycele menigeo fixa, & hyra net w\u00e6s tobrocen. & hig bicnodon hyra gefer",
